<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 97 MILLION IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 97 MILLION IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to November 15 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to November 8:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 37,541	 37,444</p>
<p> Money market intervention    10,461	 10,461</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,982	  5,982</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,274	  2,279</p>
<p> Total assets		     64,240	 64,138</p>
<p>In the previous week, to November 8, reserves rose by 741</p>
<p>million markka.    --Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
